       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "a28aa2f",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "II. Kwaliteit en kennis",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "af03695",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We kiezen voor inhoud boven lawaai. Gestructureerde gesprekken, een gedeelde kennisbank en mentoring door ervaren professionals.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "533c7a4",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "d8130de",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "III. Echte impact",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "395ac34",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>Talent binnen de ummah is groot maar verspreid. Via projectgroepen, hackathons en sharktank-sessies zetten we ideeën om in werkende projecten.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "9236494",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
